    "src/": "upstream paths, same relative layout as the upstream repository root",
    "upstream-settings.json": "upstream .claude/settings.json (the PreToolUse wiring), renamed so it is not live in Genesis"
  },
  "selection": [
    "Named pieces: core/witness/{guard,law,paths}.mjs, bin/witness.mjs, .claude/settings.json, surface/door.ts (requireSession), core/forge/crush.ts (sightBlock).",
    "Tests: test/door-write-guards.test.ts, test/sight.test.ts, and the witness tests that import guard.mjs or run the guard CLI: witness-{action-class,advice,alias-gaps,allowlist,chain,cli,corpus-verdicts,empty-bypass,governing-root,paths,session,worktree-fence}.",
    "Plus the transitive closure of every static and dynamic relative import of those files, all of core/witness/ (witness-advice reads the whole directory), core/council/readonly.mjs (door.ts names it as a runtime hook path), and the data files the tests read at runtime: conformance/cases/*.json, docs/BINDING-DECISION.md and surface/app/surface-chat.js (read as text, so its own UI imports are not carried).",
    "Also carried: the guard preregistration write-ups the guard tests cite (docs/POLARITY-PREREGISTRATION.md, docs/WORKTREE-FENCE-PREREGISTRATION.md), the law instance the upstream wiring enforced (LAW.md, aukora.law.json, aukora.pub, which is a public key), package.json (license and module type), tsconfig.json, bun-env.d.ts, .gitignore (keeps runtime .aukora/ state out of git) and PROVENANCE.md (upstream origin record)."
  ],
  "notCarried": [
    "bun.lock and devDependencies (typescript, assemblyscript, @types/node, bun-types): only typecheck and build use them. Tests and runtime use only node/bun built-ins.",
    "The rest of the surface/app UI, the rest of core/forge, the other suites and the upstream README/AGENTS.md: they are not imported by the named pieces or their tests.",
    "Secret scan of every carried file (private-key blocks, sk-/xai-/ghp_/github_pat_/AKIA/AIza/nvapi-/sk-ant- tokens, JWTs) found nothing. Two upstream test files that match those patterns (test/witness-injection.test.mjs, test/engines.test.ts) are outside this selection."
  ],
